  "notes": [
    "NEA 2003 Table 17: 20 deterministic codes vs MCNP reference 1.186550 (multi-group, 7-group transport-corrected data).",
    "Pattern: pure P1 diffusion low by ~280 pcm; SN low by 100-270 pcm; MOC within ~+130 pcm; Pn-nodal (VARIANT-ISE) +76 pcm with best power (MRE 0.11%).",
    "Table 3 is the 2D multi-group reference solutions: MCNP 1.186550, MCNP-LANL 1.186380, KENO 1.186520, VIM 1.187035."
  ],
  "reference_provenance": {
